Changes by qarge, 2026-10-10 (version 0.2.0):

- hooks/token-weather.mjs was rewritten as hooks/token-weather.tsx:
  - the context row updates on every model request of a turn (turn.step),
    not once per turn (turn.complete);
  - new 5-hour and weekly usage limit rows, read from the endpoint /usage
    reads, with the session's own credential, and from the rate-limit
    readings Claude Code pushes during a turn (session.measure);
  - one emoji scale for all rows, progress bars, remaining capacity, the
    distance to auto-compaction, and reset countdowns;
  - fixed reading e.hasSurvey and e.bodyColumns, which live under e.props.
- hooks/hooks.json names the new module.
- .claude-plugin/plugin.json: version 0.2.0, a new description, author,
  license and homepage.
- README.md was adapted from the original's to describe this version.
- tests/token-weather.test.ts and tsconfig.json are new.
- The screenshots of version 0.1.0 were removed.

Changes by qarge, 2026-10-10 (version 0.3.0):

- hooks/token-weather.tsx:
  - the context row shows cached and uncached tokens in place of the turn
    summary and the request chart;
  - an estimate, marked "~", before the first response and after /clear;
  - after /compact, an estimate from the messages compacted and their
    replacement (session.compact), in place of the old size;
  - the draft in the prompt box, pastes included, counted with the API's
    token counter, and the size of the next request (removed in 0.4.0);
  - every icon outside the emoji block carries U+FE0F.
- .claude-plugin/plugin.json: version 0.3.0 and a new description.
- README.md and the tests describe and cover the above.

Changes by qarge, 2026-10-10 (version 0.4.0):

- hooks/token-weather.tsx:
  - the draft count was removed;
  - the context figures are kept with the session id they were measured
    in: /clear and /resume drop them (session.end), a draw for another
    chat shows none, and the next chat's own figures are read.
- .claude-plugin/plugin.json: version 0.4.0 and a new description.
- README.md and the tests describe and cover the above.

Changes by qarge, 2026-10-10 (version 0.4.1):

- hooks/token-weather.tsx:
  - the limits readings are kept in the plugin's store, and a session
    starts on the last one, less any window that has reset since;
  - the first /usage read starts alongside the engine's start;
  - within one window the higher of the /usage and header figures stands.
- .claude-plugin/plugin.json: version 0.4.1.
- README.md and the tests describe and cover the above.

Changes by qarge, 2026-10-10 (version 0.4.2), after a code review:

- hooks/token-weather.tsx:
  - after /compact with no count of the messages, the row takes Claude
    Code's estimate once the engine lets go of the old size, or after 20
    seconds of counting, and not while the count is still running; a
    measure whose context didn't move is not applied;
  - the context watch tells a figure the engine hasn't taken in yet from
    one it let go, and follows a figure it lowers with no measure (a
    rewind), not one it raises before the step ends;
  - a compaction's count stops when another chat is on screen;
  - /usage's figures stand as read; only a header is kept from lowering
    one, and a header of an older window, or one that only rides along
    with a measure, is ignored;
  - a window /usage stops listing is dropped, and a reset it goes on
    listing after it passed is asked about once; a /usage read that never
    answers is let go after a minute, and a late answer is ignored; a
    login made after the start is picked up; only the 5-hour and weekly
    windows are kept and stored;
  - the band is redrawn once the start has read the window, failures of
    unawaited work are caught, and 999,950 tokens and up read as 1M.
- .claude-plugin/plugin.json: version 0.4.2.
- README.md and the tests describe and cover the above.

Changes by qarge, 2026-10-10 (version 0.4.3):

- hooks/token-weather.tsx: under 25% a lighter green, at 75–89% a darker
  orange and from 100% a darker red than the theme's own, for the dark and
  light themes (read from /config, and followed when it changes there).
- .claude-plugin/plugin.json: version 0.4.3.
- README.md and the tests describe and cover the above.

